---
title: Corretoras no Exterior
shell: true
description: |
  Tabela comparativa colaborativa de corretoras no exterior para residentes fiscais brasileiros.
  Compare custos, benefícios, e características de corretoras internacionais.
layout: application
structure:
  null:
    link:
      text: Endereço
  Custos:
    deposito_min_abertura:
      text: Depósito mínimo para abertura
    abertura:
      text: Taxas de abertura (W-8 e outros)
    corretagem_eua:
      text: Taxa de Corretagem mercado Americano
    corretagem_lse:
      text: Taxa de Corretagem mercado Britânico (LSE) em dólar
    deposito_eua:
      text: Taxa de Depósito EUA
    saque_eua:
      text: Taxa de Retirada EUA
    spread_brasil:
      text: Taxa Spread de Depósito/Retirada Brasil
    acats:
      text: Custo para transferência para outra corretora (ACATS)
    inatividade:
      text: Manutenção por inatividade
  Proteção:
    sipc:
      text: SIPC
    seguro:
      text: Seguro Adicional por Conta
  Atendimento:
    telefone:
      text: Via Telefone
    email:
      text: Via Email
    chat_humano:
      text: Humano via Chat web em tempo real
    horarios:
      text: Horários de Atendimento
    idiomas:
      text: Idiomas de Atendimento
  Produtos Financeiros:
    eua_acoes:
      text: 'EUA: Ações, ETFs, REITs, ADRs'
    eua_outros:
      text: 'EUA: Opções, Futuros, Renda Fixa'
    intl_acoes:
      text: 'Fora dos EUA (Internacional): Ações, ETFs, REITs, ADRs'
    intl_outros:
      text: 'Fora dos EUA (Internacional): Opções, Futuros, Renda Fixa'
    crypto:
      text: Criptomoedas
    fracoes:
      text: Fração de Ações
    ach_pull:
      text: Link com conta bancária americana (com ACH Pull)
    cartao_debito_fisico:
      text: Cartão de débito americano (dólar) físico entregue no Brasil
    cartao_debito_virtual:
      text: Cartão de débito americano (dólar) virtual
    cartao_credito_fisico:
      text: Cartão de crédito americano (dólar) físico entregue no Brasil
    residentes_fiscais:
      text: Exclusiva para residentes do Brasil
    relatorio_irpf_brasil:
      text: Relatório IR brasileiro
    joint:
      text: Conta conjunta (Joint account)
    margin:
      text: Conta margem (alavancagem)
    offshore:
      text: Abertura para offshore
    conta_bancaria:
      text: Conta Bancária
    conta_remunerada:
      text: Juros sobre saldo em conta corrente
  Sobre a instituição:
    ano_fundacao:
      text: Ano de fundação
    sede:
      text: Sede
    funcionarios:
      text: Número de funcionários (aproximado)
    aum:
      text: AUM (Patrimônio de clientes sob gerência)
    clientes:
      text: Número de clientes
    observacoes:
      text: Observações adicionais
  Indicação:
    referral:
      text: Código ou link de indicação
---

<%
  # Hoisted once: `CorretoraExterior.all` re-globs and re-sorts the filesystem on
  # every call, and the table needs it on every row.
  corretoras = CorretoraExterior.all
  structure = current_page.data.structure
  # Alternating row shading runs continuously across sections rather than
  # restarting in each <tbody>, so the stripe never doubles up at a boundary.
  linha = 0
  total_criterios = structure.sum { |_section, fields| fields.count }
%>

<% content_for :head do %>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    <%= raw({
      "@context" => "https://schema.org",
      "@type" => "ItemList",
      "name" => current_page.data["title"],
      "description" => page_description,
      "url" => canonical_url,
      "numberOfItems" => corretoras.count,
      "itemListElement" => corretoras.each_with_index.map { |corretora, index|
        {
          "@type" => "ListItem",
          "position" => index + 1,
          "item" => {
            "@type" => "FinancialService",
            "name" => corretora.nome,
            "url" => corretora.link.is_a?(Sitepress::Data::Record) ? corretora.link["url"] : nil
          }.compact
        }
      }
    }.to_json) %>
  </script>
<% end %>

<div class="px-4 pt-3 shrink-0">
  <details class="text-sm border-l-4 rounded-md shadow-sm bg-yellow-100 border-yellow-500 text-yellow-900 dark:bg-yellow-950 dark:border-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-100">
    <summary class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold cursor-pointer marker:text-yellow-600 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-yellow-600">
      Aviso: esta tabela é informativa e colaborativa
    </summary>
    <p class="px-4 pb-3 text-sm">
      Esta tabela é apenas informativa. Não nos responsabilizamos por eventuais mudanças nas taxas e condições das corretoras.
      Recomendamos que você verifique diretamente no site da corretora. Se qualquer informação estiver incompleta ou incorreta,
      por favor, abra uma "<a href="https://github.com/jmonteiro/comparaconta/issues" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Issue</a>" em
      <a href="https://github.com/jmonteiro/comparaconta" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">jmonteiro/comparaconta</a>.
    </p>
  </details>
</div>

<%# ------------------------------------------------------------------ toolbar %>
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 shrink-0 print:hidden" data-tabela-toolbar>
  <label class="js-only relative flex-1 min-w-[10rem] max-w-xs">
    <span class="sr-only">Filtrar critérios</span>
    <input type="search" id="filtro-criterios" placeholder="Filtrar critérios…" autocomplete="off"
           class="w-full py-1 pl-3 pr-8 text-sm bg-white border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm dark:bg-gray-900 dark:border-gray-700 dark:text-gray-100 focus:border-blue-500 focus:ring-blue-500" />
  </label>

  <details class="js-only relative" data-corretoras-menu>
    <summary class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1 text-sm bg-white border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm cursor-pointer select-none dark:bg-gray-900 dark:border-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-500 marker:content-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
      Corretoras
      <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400" data-contador-corretoras><%= corretoras.count %>/<%= corretoras.count %></span>
      <%= render "partials/icon", name: "chevron-down", classes: "w-3 h-3 fill-current" %>
    </summary>
    <div class="absolute left-0 z-50 p-2 mt-1 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-md shadow-lg dark:bg-gray-900 dark:border-gray-700 w-60">
      <div class="flex gap-2 pb-2 mb-1 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <button type="button" class="text-xs text-blue-600 underline dark:text-blue-400" data-corretoras-todas>Marcar todas</button>
        <button type="button" class="text-xs text-blue-600 underline dark:text-blue-400" data-corretoras-nenhuma>Desmarcar todas</button>
      </div>
      <% corretoras.each do |corretora| %>
        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 px-1 py-1 text-sm rounded cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800">
          <input type="checkbox" checked value="<%= corretora.slug %>" data-corretora-toggle
                 class="text-blue-600 border-gray-300 rounded dark:bg-gray-800 dark:border-gray-600 focus:ring-blue-500" />
          <%= corretora.nome %>
        </label>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="relative">
    <summary class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1 text-sm bg-white border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm cursor-pointer select-none dark:bg-gray-900 dark:border-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-500 marker:content-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
      Seções
      <%= render "partials/icon", name: "chevron-down", classes: "w-3 h-3 fill-current" %>
    </summary>
    <nav class="absolute left-0 z-50 p-2 mt-1 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-md shadow-lg dark:bg-gray-900 dark:border-gray-700 w-60" aria-label="Seções da tabela">
      <% structure.each_key do |section| %>
        <% next unless section %>
        <a href="#secao-<%= section.parameterize %>" class="block px-1 py-1 text-sm no-underline rounded text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800"><%= section %></a>
      <% end %>
    </nav>
  </details>

  <p class="ml-auto text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400" data-contador-criterios>
    <%= total_criterios %> critérios
  </p>
</div>

<p data-dica-arraste class="px-4 pb-1 text-xs text-center text-gray-500 shrink-0 sm:hidden dark:text-gray-400 print:hidden" aria-hidden="true">
  ← arraste a tabela para comparar →
</p>

<%# ------------------------------------------------------- the scrolling table %>
<div id="tabela-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region"
     aria-label="Tabela comparativa de corretoras no exterior"
     class="flex-1 min-h-0 mx-4 mb-4 overflow-auto bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md overscroll-contain ring-1 ring-black/5 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:ring-white/10 scroll-pl-[var(--label-w)] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-500 print:overflow-visible print:h-auto print:shadow-none">
  <table class="cc-table min-w-full border-separate border-spacing-0 text-xs sm:text-sm [--label-w:11rem] sm:[--label-w:18rem] [--col-w:7.5rem] sm:[--col-w:10rem] [--th-h:3.5rem]">
    <caption class="sr-only">
      Comparativo de <%= corretoras.count %> corretoras no exterior em <%= total_criterios %> critérios,
      agrupados por custos, proteção, atendimento, produtos financeiros e dados institucionais.
    </caption>

    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col" class="sticky top-0 left-0 z-50 p-0 text-left align-bottom bg-gray-200 border-b border-r border-gray-300 shadow-[6px_0_8px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.18),0_6px_8px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.18)] dark:bg-gray-800 dark:border-gray-700 print:static print:shadow-none">
          <div class="flex min-h-[var(--th-h)] w-[var(--label-w)] items-end px-2 py-2 text-[0.65rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 sm:px-4 sm:text-xs">
            Critério
          </div>
        </th>
        <% corretoras.each do |corretora| %>
          <th scope="col" data-col="<%= corretora.slug %>"
              class="sticky top-0 z-40 p-0 bg-gray-200 border-b border-gray-300 shadow-[0_6px_8px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.18)] dark:bg-gray-800 dark:border-gray-700 print:static print:shadow-none">
            <div class="flex min-h-[var(--th-h)] w-[var(--col-w)] items-center justify-center px-2 py-2 text-center text-xs font-semibold uppercase leading-tight text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200 sm:px-3">
              <span class="line-clamp-2"><%= corretora.nome %></span>
            </div>
          </th>
        <% end %>
      </tr>
    </thead>

    <%#
      One <tbody> per section. The row group is the constraint rectangle for a
      sticky cell, so each section header pins under the column header until its
      own section scrolls past, then is pushed out by the next one.
    %>
    <% structure.each do |section, fields| %>
      <tbody>
        <% if section %>
          <tr id="secao-<%= section.parameterize %>" class="scroll-mt-[var(--th-h)]" data-secao>
            <th scope="rowgroup" class="sticky left-0 z-30 top-[var(--th-h)] px-2 py-2 text-left align-middle bg-gray-100 border-b border-r border-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:border-gray-700 sm:px-4 print:static">
              <div class="w-[var(--label-w)] text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
                <%= section %>
              </div>
            </th>
            <td colspan="<%= corretoras.count %>" class="sticky z-20 top-[var(--th-h)] px-2 py-2 bg-gray-100 border-b border-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:border-gray-700 print:static"></td>
          </tr>
        <% end %>

        <% fields.each do |key, contents| %>
          <% linha += 1 %>
          <% faixa = linha.odd? ? "bg-white dark:bg-gray-900" : "bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800" %>
          <tr class="group scroll-mt-[var(--th-h)]" data-criterio="<%= contents["text"] %>">
            <th scope="row" class="sticky left-0 z-10 px-2 py-2 font-medium text-left align-top text-gray-700 border-b border-r border-gray-200 shadow-[6px_0_8px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.18)] group-hover:bg-blue-50 dark:text-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 dark:group-hover:bg-blue-950 sm:px-4 sm:py-3 print:static print:shadow-none <%= faixa %>">
              <div class="w-[var(--label-w)] hyphens-auto"><%= contents["text"] %></div>
            </th>
            <% corretoras.each do |corretora| %>
              <td data-col="<%= corretora.slug %>"
                  class="px-2 py-2 text-center align-top text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-200 group-hover:bg-blue-50 dark:text-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 dark:group-hover:bg-blue-950 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 <%= faixa %>">
                <div class="w-[var(--col-w)]">
                  <%= render "partials/cell", cell: corretora.send(key) %>
                </div>
              </td>
            <% end %>
          </tr>
        <% end %>
      </tbody>
    <% end %>

    <tbody data-sem-resultados hidden>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="<%= corretoras.count + 1 %>" class="px-4 py-6 text-sm text-center text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
          Nenhum critério corresponde ao filtro.
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
